    'hub.methodology_note': `This is not a repackaged Global Peace Index: GPI signals account for less than a third of the weight. Each score blends five pillars — conflict, crime, health, governance and environment — with a calibrated consensus of travel advisories from ${ADVISORY_GOV_COUNT_DISPLAY} governments, recomputed daily as an uncertainty-weighted geometric mean, so one weak pillar drags a country down more than a strong one lifts it. Full details on the {methodology_link}.`,
